# Placeholder so git tracks the resource directory.
#
# The actual pdfium shared library (pdfium.dll / libpdfium.so /
# libpdfium.dylib) is downloaded by `scripts/install-pdfium.mjs` —
# wired into npm's `postinstall`, `pretauri:dev`, and `pretauri:build`
# lifecycle hooks. Tauri bundles whatever is in this directory into
# the released app via the `bundle.resources` entry in
# tauri.conf.json.
